<title>USA: New York certificated cotton stocks rise to 75,336.</title>
<headline>New York certificated cotton stocks rise to 75,336.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Certificated cotton stocks deliverable against New York Cotton Exchange's No. 2 cotton futures contract as of November 11 totaled 75,336 bales, up from 75,237 bales the previous session.</p>
<p>There were 99 bales issued, no decertification orders, no cancellations, and 415 bales awaiting review.</p>
<p>-- New York Commodity Desk 212 859 1640</p>
</text>
